{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50920","headline":"幽居 · 吕从庆","name":"幽居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茅茨何潇潇，邱园复寥廓。\n黄冠此中居，眷言寄高托。\n理乱无闻声，荣辱不相着。\n有书聊把娱，有酒自斟酌。\n侵晨课田桑，归来日华薄。\n盘桓松竹间，鸟动残云落。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕从庆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50920.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50920","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}